 Extension, Delhi by 9th Corner\" title=\"Residential Interior in South Extension\">\n                            </div>\n                        </div>\n                        <div class=\"gallery-card\">\n                            <div class=\"gallery-img-wrap\">\n                                <img width=\"800\" height=\"550\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"/img/project/mr-sachin-saket/mr-sachin-saket/19.avif\" alt=\"Living space interior in Saket, Delhi by 9th Corner\" title=\"Living Space in Saket\">\n                            </div>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </section>\n\n        <!-- FAQS:auto -->\n        <section class=\"faq-section\">\n            <h2>Frequently Asked Questions</h2>\n            <div class=\"faq-list\">\n                <div class=\"faq-item\">\n                    <h3 class=\"faq-q\">Why do salons in Hauz Khas need a specialist salon interior designer?</h3>\n                    <p class=\"faq-a\">Hauz Khas salons serve a style-aware crowd, often from compact shops or upper floors. A specialist plans the space so it looks distinctive, fits every station and still leaves room for clients to move comfortably.</p>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"faq-item\">\n                    <h3 class=\"faq-q\">Can a small salon space be made to feel bigger?</h3>\n                    <p class=\"faq-a\">Yes. Mirrors, wall-mounted storage, slim stations and well-placed lighting make a compact salon feel open. We also plan wash areas and storage so the main floor stays clutter-free.</p>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"faq-item\">\n                    <h3 class=\"faq-q\">What lighting works best in a salon?</h3>\n                    <p class=\"faq-a\">Even, shadow-free light at the mirrors for accurate colour work, softer light in waiting and spa areas, and accent light for retail shelves. We plan all three layers together.</p>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"faq-item\">\n                    <h3 class=\"faq-q\">Do you work on salon branding inside the space?</h3>\n                    <p class=\"faq-a\">Yes. As your salon interior designer, we bring your logo, colours and style into the reception, feature walls and signage so the salon is easy to recognise.</p>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </section>\n        <!-- /FAQS:auto -->\n\n        <!-- CLOSING SECTION -->\n        <div class=\"closing-section\">\n            <h2>A Salon Clients Want to Come Back To</h2>\n            <p>People return to a salon for the stylist, but the space decides how long they stay. A thoughtful salon interior designer makes the stylist's job easier and the client's visit calmer.</p><p>Opening or redoing a salon in Hauz Khas? <a href=\"/hauzkhas/contact\">Speak to 9th Corner</a> and tell us about your chairs, services and budget.</p>\n        </div>\n\n    </div>\n"}